OL,3,AYou Can See Everything documentary
OL,4,Astuns with huge box office debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FA three-hour documentary on the tech
OL,7,Ffraudster Elizabeth Holmes has raked in
OL,8,Fa whopping $15 million (#11.25m) on its
OL,9,Fbox office debut, despite a limited run
OL,10,Fat 855 screens across the US and
OL,11,FCanada.
OL,13,FThe eagerly anticipated A24 film,
OL,14,Ftitled You Can See Everything, was
OL,15,Fco-directed by comedian Nathan Fielder
OL,16,Fand Lance Oppenheim.
OL,18,FIt finds Holmes at her home in 2023
OL,19,Fduring the month before she began an
OL,20,F11-year prison sentence.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
